  "description": "PLCcom for S7 is a .NET library (SDK) for reading and writing data of Siemens SIMATIC S7 controllers: S7-300/400, S7-1200/1500, S7-200, LOGO! and WinAC RTX. It supports Put/Get access with absolute addresses and symbolic access to S7-1200/1500 by variable name, optionally encrypted with TLS 1.3. Try it right away: with blank license fields the library runs with full functionality for 15 minutes during a debugging session. For uninterrupted work, generate a free trial license (14 days) at https://www.indi-an.com/en/plccom/for-s7/fors7-download/",
  "iconFile": "PLCcom_mittel_quadratisch.png",
